// Lab MCP overlay — deliberately empty.
//
// G3 A/B runs must be hermetic: no MCP servers at all. The memory MCP
// in particular is OFF entirely (not repointed at a shared or persistent
// store) so attempt n cannot read notes written by attempt n-1. If a
// future run needs scratch memory, point a memory server at a disposable
// per-attempt file instead of enabling a persistent store.
{
  "mcpServers": {}
}
